<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">
  <DocumentRef id="3c8ff7c4-61fc-488a-a469-dcc908548d91" />
  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d21b585e-6c93-483c-a32b-a540c2cdb218">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats />
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. HARBOR PARKING LOT - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0fa83cd6-2c22-4c65-ba25-cbc26a313df7">
      <Text>Rain on the windshield of a dented blue </Text>
      <Text TagNumber="1">pickup truck</Text>
      <Text>. DANA REYES (30s, ferry mechanic, coffee in a thermos) sits behind the wheel, watching the last ferry load.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e14e18ad-4911-4ff2-acaa-6aa2d634f94e">
      <Text>A TICKET AGENT waves a </Text>
      <Text TagNumber="3">flashlight</Text>
      <Text> at the line of cars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5280449-2e11-4f72-8751-0b413744a087">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7f45aaf3-7754-4d10-82b7-528ae7af0c3f">
      <Text>(to herself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c2d9c50e-1f34-4251-8433-68d18f0d3663">
      <Text>Twelve minutes. Plenty of time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17f1e8c2-7b52-4484-b0e7-58953d7ba8f9">
      <Text>She grabs a </Text>
      <Text TagNumber="2">canvas tool bag</Text>
      <Text> from the passenger seat and runs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1ebe6135-b2d1-4d3c-82c5-fd231cd46e1b">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats />
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. FERRY - ENGINE ROOM - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="066d9a4b-8d9a-432a-869d-e861b450055e">
      <Text>Hot, loud, dim. Pipes sweat. MILO OKAFOR (60s, chief engineer, reading glasses on a cord) taps a pressure gauge with a </Text>
      <Text TagNumber="4">wrench</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2abed32-c854-4380-a622-3a94ca61f3c0">
      <Text>MILO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e1c3d5b-b471-4f82-b03d-f8740c83b9a1">
      <Text>You're late.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec91269e-0ad8-479e-a0b6-ee61a81b2793">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="545787c7-86ec-4af5-8ddb-d5d860a453dd">
      <Text>I'm early for tomorrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6aa0ef11-b70b-4f53-89f4-1de6690fd6a9">
      <Text>MILO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66fc194d-13fa-4157-a129-0ac3fbccdcd4">
      <Text>The port engine's been coughing since Seattle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2436bba7-5a46-4151-9a6f-be60e9ae1005">
      <Text>Dana kneels at the engine, opens her tool bag, pulls out a </Text>
      <Text TagNumber="3">flashlight</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="054ebd40-6316-4a63-bf60-7ad1044504c4">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="934519a7-d1ab-46f2-941b-cfe26da76d53">
      <Text>Hand me the torque wrench.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6bb839a0-3f0a-4a09-8e2d-c9727c85d684">
      <Text>He does. Their hands touch the same tool for a beat too long.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="53c8245b-bb44-4f45-a194-137179720dad">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats />
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. FERRY - UPPER DECK - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97d2e3c3-9493-489e-999a-0417e5f9fe20">
      <Text>Wind. Rain. PASSENGERS huddle under the overhang. A GIRL (8) in a yellow raincoat presses her face to the railing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b73790d5-ea4c-429b-85a6-195234622439">
      <Text>Dana climbs the ladder, wiping grease off on her jeans. She spots the girl.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="16f29e69-9fbe-4b68-a4f2-390d55f3c000">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37655e10-ea5d-42f5-a336-c92d7fa3a8ea">
      <Text>Where are your people?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dad9e7a4-0826-4434-aca7-360e0752cb5a">
      <Text>GIRL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e87d756e-5633-472a-9a86-0fc0e5512724">
      <Text>Inside. I wanted to see the lighthouse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a2ea5d5-4539-4ecc-b6f2-8ef7b18200e9">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49000f32-a21e-405b-a0a8-e3116547cad3">
      <Text>That's the lighthouse. Now you've seen it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb78faa4-8292-4e3b-a3b1-323158aba9d7">
      <Text>The lighthouse beam sweeps across them both.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="004922ac-11c3-4e6e-837f-af20fdd253ee">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats />
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. FERRY - PASSENGER CABIN - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a46200ef-d6ac-4f2a-a108-ebe333482fab">
      <Text>Rows of vinyl seats. A vending machine hums. CAPTAIN ROSA VEGA (50s, uniform, radio on her hip) walks the aisle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cd21ddf-eba3-42e3-9bdc-55de7625ddaf">
      <Text>CAPTAIN VEGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6bf57219-ef7a-4ff4-9301-3215cccc55df">
      <Text>(into radio)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b17ad4c-f22c-4fa7-8e7c-c2ca83298d2b">
      <Text>Engine room, talk to me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df8bd880-8576-422a-bf2a-a6f2d30b4d50">
      <Text>MILO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="206b866d-b3fa-4380-9fc8-fbb4da47946a">
      <Text>(over radio)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ddf0da57-5723-4b1e-a6f2-fa2228a57bea">
      <Text>Dana's on it. Give us ten.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7547d26-f687-46f9-bbda-d91994680374">
      <Text>Captain Vega finds the girl's MOTHER asleep across three seats and gently shakes her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3be978ec-7967-41e9-816b-8aff8238124d">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats />
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. FERRY - ENGINE ROOM - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9a1027e-bc3f-4f8f-8830-021f12b2e55a">
      <Text>Dana tightens a fitting. The engine note smooths out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="61841fd4-be1b-4ea2-a916-15c6b4bd079f">
      <Text>MILO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76cb3906-7b58-4825-ae0a-f7c046fb50b2">
      <Text>Listen to that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a308bf5-2062-420c-8039-e551e89ed30e">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d369f3f-2860-4e95-9c1f-fc2a3abbc038">
      <Text>That's the sound of me getting paid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ef9e670-6bfb-4ac2-a218-7b9b3c287eba">
      <Text>Milo laughs, then coughs. He hides a pill bottle in his coat pocket. Dana sees it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6aa214c-9701-4018-abfe-a547d0c1c2a0">
      <Text>DANA (CONT'D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5557da85-775c-4190-a05c-38eb336c9e1a">
      <Text>Milo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cabc14eb-9f48-456c-88a4-19b6fecb8114">
      <Text>MILO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e63d8d35-0567-4005-a1e1-ac3630db8903">
      <Text>Not tonight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0d18e719-ab6d-4d54-9352-ce1d0d6cffff">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats />
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. ISLAND DOCK - DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5928f5ab-4814-4b3a-bf45-a19834640bf3">
      <Text>The ferry noses into the slip. Gulls. Dana walks off with her tool bag, Milo beside her. The girl waves from the deck in her yellow raincoat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2f39278-893a-482f-b6a6-a1c7155702e8">
      <Text>MILO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32ee4305-f723-46b1-acae-5568babef1b1">
      <Text>Same time tomorrow?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11e638c6-871b-4b2f-bb89-4cd9905d7e29">
      <Text>DANA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12114fe0-37fa-4cf7-b625-105fa455d46f">
      <Text>I'll bring the coffee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee445a28-9dae-44e9-879a-c8fcc9eb3216">
      <Text>FADE OUT.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>
